Get order book summary
Retrieves the order book summary for a specific token

GET
/
book

Try it
Query Parameters
​
token_id
stringrequired
The unique identifier for the token

Response

200

application/json
Successful response

​
market
stringrequired
Market identifier

Example:
"0x1b6f76e5b8587ee896c35847e12d11e75290a8c3934c5952e8a9d6e4c6f03cfa"

​
asset_id
stringrequired
Asset identifier

Example:
"1234567890"

​
timestamp
string<date-time>required
Timestamp of the order book snapshot

Example:
"2023-10-01T12:00:00Z"

​
hash
stringrequired
Hash of the order book state

Example:
"0xabc123def456..."

​
bids
object[]required
Array of bid levels

Show child attributes

​
asks
object[]required
Array of ask levels

Show child attributes

​
min_order_size
stringrequired
Minimum order size for this market

Example:
"0.001"

​
tick_size
stringrequired
Minimum price increment

Example:
"0.01"

​
neg_risk
booleanrequired
Whether negative risk is enabled

Example:
false

